; =====================================================================
; cddl-snippets.cddl
;
; VERBATIM -- these are RFC 9277's own bytes. Every region below is the
; cached source lifted by line range, with the RFC's SIX-SPACE LEFT
; MARGIN INTACT, so this file is NOT parseable as CDDL: the margin is
; part of what is being preserved. The tool-readable companion is
; cddl-snippets-dedented.derived.cddl, which is derived and says so.
;
; FOUR snippets, and NOT ONE OF THEM IS AN ENVELOPE. C01 and C02
; (Appendix B.1) carry only the INNER content-format tag with no outer
; 55799/55800, so neither matches a file written per section 2.2 or
; section 2.3. C03 and C04 (Appendix D.1) DO carry their outer tag,
; 55801. That asymmetry is a source defect and is recorded in README.md.
;
; EVERY ONE OF THE FOUR IS A TAG ASSERTION -- #6.<n>(...) -- which is
; the mechanism MD-3's option 5 excludes. A derived CDDL for the three
; envelopes is envelopes.derived.cddl, and it is derived by construction
; because the document supplies no CDDL for its own envelopes.
;
; C01 CONTRADICTS APPENDIX B FOR THE DOCUMENT'S OWN EXAMPLE. Appendix B:
; "Exceptionally, when used immediately as tag content of one of the
; tags 55799, 55800, or 55801, the tag content is as follows: Tag 55799
; (Section 2.2): One of: 1. The CBOR data item within the representation
; (without byte-" / "string wrapping)." Section 2.2.1's envelope is
; therefore 55799(1668546929([{...}])) with the tag content an ARRAY,
; and `senml-cbor = #6.1668546929(bstr)` does not match it. B.1 is
; introduced by a cross-reference to section 2.2.1, so a reader is
; actively invited to apply the rule to the example it does not fit.
;
; Source: RFC 9277, cached source sha256
;   bd637eafad9ef940c8f5d029076f70c58af7bde6beb38efee5ba7af3690289f7
; =====================================================================

; --- C01  Appendix B.1  content-format 112, application/senml+cbor -- INNER TAG ONLY
;     source lines 810-810   region sha256 4b58e806faccce8abd47678b4a26f4519c41917a9a1055edf93550825aae8a21
      senml-cbor = #6.1668546929(bstr)

; --- C02  Appendix B.1  content-format 272, application/missing-blocks+cbor-seq -- INNER TAG ONLY
;     source lines 825-825   region sha256 82b9e6793cae5e0a671ca56ebb9856ff8db7e76e4048b63debf51644363dafe6
      missing-blocks = #6.1668547090(bstr)

; --- C03  Appendix D.1  content-format 432, application/td+json -- outer tag 55801 included
;     source lines 923-923   region sha256 bba455f2eadb41e5d9ad801a958148d9ea7a03e6645efe80c232c575ff416960
      td-json-header = #6.55801(#6.1668547250('BOR'))

; --- C04  Appendix D.1  content-format 11050, application/json in deflate -- outer tag 55801 included
;     source lines 934-934   region sha256 2453a98e20afdea71a06ca5e2ddc6f969a19f6ae3d4ef94ded10fd429fc16db5
      json-deflate-header = #6.55801(#6.1668557910('BOR'))

